  "worked_solution": "The given curve is the graph of $y=cos\u2061x.$\n\nNotice that, because the cosine function is even, it is symmetric about the $y$-axis, i.e.,\n\n$$\ncos\u2061(-x)=cos\u2061x\n$$\n\nSo the graph could also be viewed as $y=cos\u2061(-x).$",
